  <iati-identifier>XM-DAC-7-PPR-4000006281</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-7" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the second phase of the One Wash National Programme through the World Bank in Ethiopia.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity concerns a contribution to the Multi-Donor trust fund of the World Bank in Ethiopia, which was set up for the One WASH National Programme on our request, following a political decision to not provide direct support to the Government of Ethiopia, in the aftermath of the conflict with Tigray. After our contributions enter the trust fund, they will then be disbursed into the Consolidated Wash Account, which will then be used to finance activities, carried out by the ministry of water, that are aimed to increase access to safe water supply, sanitation and hygiene services and strengthen the capacity for water resources management for service delivery. Currently since the project delayed due to security situation across the country, a request to extend the project implementation until June 30, 2026 was received from the WB.</narrative>
  </description>
